      "widgets_values": [
        "## DiffRhythm 2: lyrics and style to song\n\n- Write lyrics with section tags: [start] [intro] [verse] [chorus] [bridge] [inst] [solo] [outro] [end]\n- Style prompt (音乐风格提示词) in the DiffRhythm2 node, max length (歌曲最大长度) up to 210 s by default\n- To copy the style of a song instead, un-bypass **Load Audio** (Ctrl+B) and pick the reference.\n\nWeights auto-download on first run to `models/TTS/DiffRhythm/` (ASLP-lab/DiffRhythm2, MuQ-MuLan-large, xlm-roberta-base). Needs `espeak-ng` installed on the system. Licence Apache-2.0."
